## Context

Wave-1 integration review of the 2026-06-06 raid (PR #329, ticket
0216) flagged: the rewritten skills/gaze/SKILL.md states that phases
2-4 reviewer agents and the phase-6 gate agent must be read-only with
pinned cwd and must NOT receive isolation:"worktree" (which cuts a
fresh tree from main and reproduces the wrong-branch drift 0216
killed); only the REROLL fix agent gets isolation. This is a
correctness constraint enforced by prose only — a future editorial
pass could silently drop it. tests/test_verify_fork_contracts.py (the
0193 ratchet) checks cwd threading and containment text but not this
prohibition.

## Actions

1. Add an assertion to tests/test_verify_fork_contracts.py: the gaze
   phases 2-4/6 sections must contain the isolation prohibition for
   reviewer/gate agents, and the only isolation:"worktree" occurrence
   in the file is the REROLL fix-agent block.
2. Prove RED by deleting the prohibition sentence locally.

## Test

Ratchet test RED on a gaze text without the prohibition; GREEN on
current main.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Ratchet assertion in tests/test_verify_fork_contracts.py
- [ ] RED proof recorded in the PR body
- [ ] make check-fast passes
